  "@premiumBetaPrivacyLink": {"description": "FINAL (Legal Review, approved by Peter 2026-11-03 20:32, handoff 2026-11-03-pm-revenuecat-final section 4): use exactly as written. Premium page: link under the free unlock's status to the privacy policy's section #premium-beta"},
